                            "en": "<h3><strong>360 Istanbul Restaurant</strong></h3><p><strong>Dining Style:</strong> Fine Dining</p><p><strong>Cuisine: </strong>International, Turkish</p><p><strong>Service Hours: </strong>Dinner &amp; Late Night Bar</p><p><strong>Dress Code: S</strong>mart casual</p><p><strong>Location: </strong><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/RUBY+RESTAURANT/@41.0476109,29.0249553,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x14cab7c85d58878d:0xfa4687227dedcd0!8m2!3d41.0476109!4d29.0249553!16s%2Fg%2F11fxzhmkpw?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAxNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\"><u>Yıldız, Ortaköy Salhanesi Sk. No:5, 34349 Beşiktaş/İstanbul</u></a></p><p><strong>Reservation Policy: </strong>Reservation needed<strong> at least 3 days before</strong></p>",
