                    {
                        "id": 118,
                        "title": {
                            "en": "About Restaurant",
                            "ko": ""
                        },
                        "text": {
                            "en": "<h3><strong>About 360 Istanbul Restaurant</strong></h3><p>360 Istanbul is a top restaurant and entertainment venue, widely considered one of the best restaurants in Istanbul. Located in the historic Misir Apartment, it offers:</p><p>• &nbsp;Breathtaking 360-degree views of Istanbul<br>• &nbsp;Delicious international and modern Turkish cuisine<br>• &nbsp;Exclusive wine selection and rich bar menu<br>• &nbsp;Lunch and dinner service<br>• &nbsp;Live shows and famous DJs from abroad<br>• &nbsp;Exciting night life in İstanbul with its club atmosphere</p><p>As one of the best restaurants in the city, 360 Istanbul perfectly combines food, atmosphere, entertainment and ambiance for an unforgettable experience. The expert team ensures the highest level of customer satisfaction, making it stand out among other top restaurants.<br>Come enjoy a memorable meal at one of Istanbul's best restaurants with panoramic Istanbul views at 360.&nbsp;<br>Savor creative dishes made from fresh, quality ingredients along with an innovative drink menu, all at 360 Restaurant.<br>360 Istanbul - where food, fun, comfort and amazing city scene come together!</p>",
                            "ko": ""
                        },
                        "last_update": "2026-06-02 10:21:59"
                    },
